board-sort-key="start-ehb" data-public-leaderboard-sort-type="number" data-public-leaderboard-sort-label="@T["Start EHB"]" aria-label="@T["Sort by Start EHB"]"><span>@T["Start EHB"]</span><svg class="public-ui-table-sort-icon" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6" /></svg></button></th><th class="public-ui-supporting-text" scope="col" aria-sort="none"><button type="button" class="public-ui-table-sort-control" data-public-leaderboard-sort-control data-public-leaderboard-sort-key="end-ehb" data-public-leaderboard-sort-type="number" data-public-leaderboard-sort-label="@T["End EHB"]" aria-label="@T["Sort by End EHB"]"><span>@T["End EHB"]</span><svg class="public-ui-table-sort-icon" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6" /></svg></button></th><th class="public-ui-supporting-text" scope="col">@T["WOM"]</th></tr></thead>
